From e073e4551d00b2f34e67232082d4606665a52152 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:37:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] FORK-10 (d, click): a box for each mod entity and
 mod-entity-used

Each mod entity gets an interaction entity of the kind's size as its box (kept with the display, moved with the entity, swept with the carriers). A right click on it reaches the mod that owns the kind through the new mod-entity-used export; true takes the click. The entity's menu is not in this patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
